        "department": "ECE",
        "description": "This course is designed to prepare the fundamental concepts of semiconductor physics, which are necessary to understand electronic devices. It will introduce students to the materials, transport mechanisms, and basic insight into various electronic and optoelectronic devices such as pn junction diodes, Schottky diodes, solar cells, LEDs, and the foundation of MOSFET. This course will ensure that students, even with a minimal background in semiconductors, grasp the concepts and prepare for more advanced courses in semiconductor technology.",
